What:		/sys/block/zram<id>/writeback_stat
Date:		July 2026
Contact:	xkse4 <xkse4@outlook.com>
Description:
		Read-only counters for the contiguous ZRAM backing-write path.

		The five whitespace-separated unsigned values are:

		1. multi-page batches submitted successfully
		2. pages submitted through multi-page batches
		3. contiguous-allocation fallbacks to single-page I/O
		4. backing-block allocation failures
		5. backing write I/O failures
Users:		ZRAM diagnostics and regression testing
